.TH SSX-NG-LINUX 1 "September 2026" "ShadowsocksX-NG Linux 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ssx-ng-linux \- start the ShadowsocksX-NG Linux desktop client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ssx-ng-linux
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ssx-ng-linux
starts a tray-first Shadowsocks desktop client for GNOME and Ubuntu.
It manages a local ss-local process, optional HTTP and PAC services, server
profiles, SIP003 plugins, and GNOME system proxy settings.
.PP
Only one application instance may run for each user. Configuration and runtime
state are stored with owner-only permissions.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/shadowsocksx-ng-linux/config.json
Application settings and server profiles.
.TP
.I ~/.config/shadowsocksx-ng-linux/app.log
Proxy runtime log.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ssx-ng-tool (1),
.BR ss-local (1)
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/fattoliu/shadowsocksx-ng-linux/issues.
